## Component patterns (this design system)

### Button / IconButton / LinkButton
```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
<button type="button" className="ds-button" disabled={isDisabled}>
  {label}
</button>

// ❌ BAD — div with click only, no keyboard, no role
<div onClick={handleClick}>{label}</div>
```
- Min height/width for hit area: 24px (AA), 44px preferred (AAA)
- Focus ring: use `--ds-*` focus tokens; never remove outline
- Disabled: `disabled` attribute (not just styled); do not remove from tab order if it performs an action — use `aria-disabled` only when appropriate

### Checkbox / Radio / Switch
- Native `<input>` + `<label>`; group with `<fieldset>` + `<legend>`
- `aria-describedby` for helper/error text
- Checked/indeterminate states programmatically determinable

### Tooltip
- Trigger must be keyboard-focusable
- Content: `role="tooltip"`, `id` linked via `aria-describedby`
- Dismissable with Esc; hoverable without disappearing (1.4.13)
- Do not put essential info only in tooltips

### Modal / BottomSheet
- Focus trap with initial focus on first interactive element
- `role="dialog"`, `aria-modal="true"`, `aria-labelledby` pointing to title
- Esc closes; focus returns to trigger on close
- Background scroll locked; focused element not fully obscured (2.4.11)

### Slider / FlexibleRange
- Provide text input alternative for precise values (2.5.7)
- `aria-valuemin`, `aria-valuemax`, `aria-valuenow`, `aria-valuetext`
- Keyboard: arrow keys adjust value

### Spinner / Progress
- `role="progressbar"` with `aria-valuenow`, `aria-valuemin`, `aria-valuemax`
- If indeterminate: `aria-busy="true"` on container + visible text "Loading…"

### Typography / Text
- Use semantic headings (`DsTypography` variant = correct HTML element)
- Line height ≥1.5 for body text
- Do not disable user text-spacing overrides in CSS

